<title>USA: Communications and Ent. changes name.</title>
<headline>Communications and Ent. changes name.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Communications and Entertainment Corp on Tuesday said it has officially changed its corporate name to Odyssey Pictures Corporation.</p>
<p>The name change has been approved by the shareholders, and became official last week, the company said in a statement.</p>
</text>
